<title>SINGAPORE: Nobel Design debuts at high of S$0.55.</title>
<headline>Nobel Design debuts at high of S$0.55.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of interior design and furniture firm Nobel Design Holdings Ltd hit a high of Singapore $0.55 on its debut on the Stock Exchange of Singapore on Monday.  </p>
<p>At 0114 GMT, Nobel's shares were at S$0.475, a premium of 44 percent over its initial public offer price of S$0.33.</p>
<p>Nobel had offered 20 million shares at S$0.33 each, including a placement tranche of five million shares.</p>
<p>Its initial public offer was 124.75 times subscribed, the highest so far this year in Singapore.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
